### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Token rusak dan token kosong — tetap 401
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Token asal-asalan — 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/karyawan?page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer token.yang.tidak.sah

> {% client.test("401", function () { client.assert(response.status === 401, "status " + response.status); }); %}

### 3.2 Header Authorization tanpa nilai — 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/karyawan?page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer

> {% client.test("401", function () { client.assert(response.status === 401, "status " + response.status); }); %}
